# Natively, a program that prints leaves the default handler's `()` tuple
# live at exit (KI-119). A fixture with a leak of its own states one bound
# for both on its own line.
expect-leak: llvm_heap <= 1: KI-119 the default handler's unit tuple

# Fixtures with leaks of their own, attributed by allocation site; the
# count includes KI-119's block where it is there too.
